('ielts-wrt-discussion-001', 'ielts-2026-01', 'IELTS', ARRAY['IELTS'], 'writing', 'ielts-writing-task2-discussion', 'Discuss Both Views', 'Classroom or Online Lessons', 'Some people believe that secondary school students learn best in a physical classroom, while others think that online lessons taken at home can be just as effective. Discuss both these views and give your own opinion. Give reasons for your answer and include relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience. Write at least 250 words. Suggested time: 40 minutes.', 2400, 0, 25, 'medium', ARRAY['Original practice', 'IELTS', 'Writing', 'Task 2'], 'Give each view its own body paragraph with reasons and examples, and state your own opinion clearly in the introduction and the conclusion. Your opinion may support one view or combine both. Discussing only one view, or giving no opinion, leaves part of the task unanswered.'),
